PERMITTED:
- Referencing this Action from a GitHub Actions workflow
  (uses: Darknode-Official/scan-action@<ref>) to scan repositories you
  own or are authorised to scan, and running it, unmodified, on
  GitHub-hosted or self-hosted runners for that purpose.
- Reading the source to review what the Action does.

THE DARKNODE CODE SCANNER:
At run time the Action downloads the Darknode Code Scanner from
https://github.com/Darknode-Official/darknode-web at one pinned commit
and checks every file against a SHA-256 recorded in action.yml. Those
files are covered by the darknode-web LICENSE. Running them, unmodified,
through this Action as described under PERMITTED is allowed. No other
right in them is granted.

